SDV aebs:

VSS :
    Sensor Signal Camera (SSP:5+/-0ms, DL: 1+/-0ms)
    Sensor Signal Lidar (SSP:5+/-0ms, DL: 1+/-0ms)
    Sensor Signal Radar (SSP:5+/-0ms, DL: 1+/-0ms)
    Actuator Signal Brake (periodic 5+/-0ms, AD: 1+/-0ms)    
    Actuator Signal Alarm (triggered on event, AD: 1+/-0ms)
App :
    Component Fusion
        service S1:
            subscribe to VSS signal Camera (Camera)
            subscribe to VSS signal Lidar (Lidar)
            subscribe to VSS signal Radar (Radar)
            publish Fusion_data
            periodic 5+/-0ms
            ExecTime 1+/-0ms
    Component AEB_controler
        service S2:
            subscribe to Fusion_data (Fusion_data)
            publish to VSS signal Alarm (Alarm)
            publish to VSS signal Brake (Brake)
            triggered on Fusion_data
            ExecTime 1+/-0ms

Functional Chains:
    chain : Camera -> S1 -> S2 -> Brake